OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and roads
OL,4,Awarnings as Scotland prepares for Storm
OL,5,ABoelo
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrain services have been cancelled and
OL,8,Fpolice have warned against unnecessary
OL,9,Froad journeys as Scotland prepares for
OL,10,Fthe arrival of Storm Boelo.
OL,12,FHeavy rain and strong winds are
OL,13,Fexpected during the second named storm
OL,14,Fto hit in two days, with gusts of up to
OL,15,F80mph forecast.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
