OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and roads
OL,4,Awarnings as Scotland prepares for Storm
OL,5,ABoelo
OL,6,
OL,7,FMost of the country is covered by a
OL,8,Fyellow Met Office warning from midday
OL,9,Fon Saturday, while a more severe amber
OL,10,Falert takes effect from 21:00 on
OL,11,FSaturday until 21:00 on Sunday,
OL,12,Fcovering the mainland and Western
OL,13,FIsles.
OL,15,FForecasters say the storm, which is the
OL,16,Fsecond named storm in two days, could
OL,17,Fresult in injury, flying debris, power
OL,18,Fcuts and damage to trees and buildings.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
